png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> does not benefit from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/38px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/50px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Extra Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\">Extra Attack</a> so martial classes only get a single additional attack from the elixir.</li>\n<li>This item spawns randomly with some rarity for many <a href=\"/wiki/Traders\" title=\"Traders\">traders</a>. It has a 38% chance to be stocked between levels 1-5, 22% for levels 6-8 and 11% for levels 9-12 from their <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_Table\" title=\"Elixir Table\">Elixir Table</a></li>\n<li>Enemies killed by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cull_the_Weak\" title=\"Cull the Weak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp/20px-Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp/30px-Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp/40px-Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cull the Weak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp/20px-Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cull_the_Weak\" title=\"Cull the Weak\">Cull the Weak</a> or <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nyrulna\" title=\"Nyrulna\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Nyrulna_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Nyrulna_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Nyrulna_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Nyrulna_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Nyrulna_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Nyrulna_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Nyrulna_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Nyrulna_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/12/Nyrulna_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nyrulna\" title=\"Nyrulna\">Nyrulna's</a> area damage do not trigger any benefit from this Elixir.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 446.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 444.66666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ana-popescu-potions-3.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Concept art by Ana Popescu\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Ana-popescu-potions-3.jpg/667px-Ana-popescu-pot